        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "A. All stewards must be members of this Union in good standing, and their duties shall consist of examining all working dues books and cards, issued to bricklayers, stone masons, and apprentices at any time, in his judgment, it is necessary but as far as possible, without inconveniencing the Employer.",
            "block_bbox": [
                64,
                363,
